{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t建造業議會通報應用程式伺服器被入侵，初步涉及約50萬註冊工人姓名及身份證號碼等外洩。<br/>\n<br/>\n創新科技及工業局局長孫東出席一個活動致辭時表示，近日網絡攻擊非常嚴重，要堅持發展與安全並重，做好風險管理，政府和業界要共同努力應對挑戰。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T12:09:14.148172+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T11:31:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T13:57:27.890365+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T12:02:50.521404+00:00","content_hash":"04f3564e367a78ea3515169495ca022c77e6991e719d862d8d96fe1ec4df5cbe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}